Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||10-20-1999||09:44 PM||||Some idiot in a early 90's saturn pulled behind me at a light last night. I was just sitting there in my gold '86 SE waiting for the light to change, then she just gassed it before the light even turned green! My month old paintjob is now ruined, my engine is idling wierd, and it VERY difficult to get into gear. To top it off, the insurance company she stated as "hers" says they have never heard of her. Also... how do i get my hood open without the latch? I can't quite seem to fit a torx bit through the gap between the front fascia and hood to take off the fascia. the latch is DESTROYED and cannot be popped open. again, what is the easies way? (that will leave my car and new paint in good condition)||||reg||9
