Z||000008||RFMike||10-22-1999||07:51 AM||||Stetz,<BR>Take off the side moldings and remove the fasteners on the sides.  This will allow the facia to pivot enough to get between the hood and the facia.<BR>Sorry I took so long- been busy.  My lady is out of town, riding herd on the kids alone sucks.<BR>Let me know if you are still having trouble.<BR>Also, Mike Backus is right.  You should have a police report filed immediately, if you haven't already.  You're insurance company or agent is full of crap.  Your rates will not change if you sue.  In fact, if she rear ended you while the light was red, it is to your benefit, because she will be found about 90-95% at fault.  Ya, I know you weren't 5-10% at fault, but that is how it works, unless you had an unimpeachable witness, such as a police officer.  Go get her.<BR>Mike||||reg||1
